# This repository is intended to become public. Anything here is either
# internal working material or something that would help an attacker, and
# neither belongs in a portfolio repo.
# A '#' only starts a comment at the START of a line. Written on the same
# line as a pattern it becomes part of the pattern, and the rule silently
# matches nothing — so every note here is on its own line.

